        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>意林创刊</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    width: 560px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    border-left: 3px solid #3f7fd0;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 12px 0 20px 0;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n\n  /* Header row: title tag at left, arrow ribbon at right */\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 0 14px 0 12px;\n    margin-bottom: 26px;\n  }\n\n  .title-tag {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 2px solid #3f7fd0;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    padding: 4px 12px;\n    background: #eaf2fb;\n    color: #1b4f8f;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n\n  .arrow-ribbon {\n    width: 130px;\n    height: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .placeholder {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    border: 1px dashed #b9c7d6;\n    color: #8b9aab;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    background: #fafcfe;\n  }\n\n  /* Highlighted heading lines with heart bullet and leaf decoration */\n  .band {\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    padding: 0 10px 0 34px;\n    margin: 22px 0 16px 0;\n    min-height: 46px;\n  }\n\n  .heart {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 40px;\n    top: 2px;\n    width: 16px;\n    height: 16px;\n  }\n\n  .band-text {\n    color: #e8484f;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    padding-left: 22px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n\n  .leaf {\n    width: 46px;\n    height: 40px;\n    margin-left: auto;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .body-block {\n    padding: 0 26px 0 34px;\n  }\n\n  .body-block p {\n    margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n\n  .spacer {\n    height: 18px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <span class=\"title-tag\">意林创刊</span>\n      <div class=\"arrow-ribbon placeholder\">[Decoration: row of blue right-pointing triangles, top-right]</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"band\">\n      <div class=\"heart placeholder\">[♥]</div>\n      <div class=\"band-text\">2023年7月，《意林》将迎来她的20岁。</div>\n      <div class=\"leaf placeholder\">[Decoration: leaf sprig, right]</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"body-block\">\n      <p>《意林》的20年，是风华正茂仍守正创新，是惊涛骇浪却勇立潮头的20年。</p>\n      <p>《意林》的20年，是一匹黑马走出吉林，面向中国，奔往世界的20年。</p>\n      <p>《意林》的20年，是中国期刊史上不会被遗忘的一朵空谷幽兰，是中国人20年来精神文化坐标轴上无法被抹除的一片养眼绿意。</p>\n      <p>20岁的人生可以不惜一切追寻梦想，挑战命运，无惧失败。</p>\n      <p>20岁的《意林》，同样敢于乘风破浪，勇为人先。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"spacer\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"band\">\n      <div class=\"heart placeholder\">[♥]</div>\n      <div class=\"band-text\">问人生能有几个十年，历尽繁华不如正当青春。</div>\n      <div class=\"leaf placeholder\">[Decoration: leaf sprig, right]</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"body-block\">\n      <p>20岁，意气风发，青春正好；20岁，却也初窥世事沧桑。</p>\n      <p>20岁，有想征服世界的野心，也有付诸课堂内外的努力。</p>\n      <p>为庆祝《意林》杂志创刊20周年，感恩您与《意林》风雨同舟的20年，《意林》将用10万元征集100篇\"我的20岁\"故事集结出版。</p>\n      <p>我们诚邀《意林》的同龄人——20周岁的你，讲述你的20岁故事，你的成长，你人生最初的\"向前一步\"。</p>\n      <p>我们也欢迎那些当年在《意林》的陪伴下已经度过20岁的朋友，回望青春年华，为自己写就\"重返20岁\"不一样的人生故事。</p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
